<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 18/19.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 18/19.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Monday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for August 18/19. The kroon is</p>
<p>pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	    August 15-18    August 15-18</p>
<p>    CZK     0.42838	 0.43337</p>
<p>    DKK     2.10026	 2.10098</p>
<p>    FIM     2.6689	  2.66652</p>
<p>    GBP    23.38012	23.50014</p>
<p>    HUF     0.07408	 0.07446</p>
<p>    LTL     3.62775	 3.68803</p>
<p>    LVL    24.91919	25.17914</p>
<p>    RUR     0.0025	  0.00254</p>
<p>    SEK     1.82581	 1.83675</p>
<p>    UAH     7.83371	 7.96501</p>
<p>    USD    14.5092	 14.7512</p>
<p>    XEU    15.71491	15.73584</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
